    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "During our previous routine inspection, one of our people was assaulted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every household must now submit to a search, both for Infected and the attacker. Should we find them, we will execute them on the spot, and the household that harbored them will be punished accordingly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't want a hard labor sentence, turn them in. No one will come to harm if you do your civic duty, and the offenders and Infected will meet their proper end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, we'll start from the first household.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_snowconutryinside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks like the day came after all. There's no chance I'll make it through this one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't go out there, Talulah! Hide behind the shed... they won't look there! We'll tell them you were scared of what was coming and ran away! No one'd blame you for it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they might hurt you for it. I owe you better than that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've left you some gold coins... from Victoria. Spend them sparingly, and they'll have you warm and well fed for the rest of your lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, Talulah! Where are you going? My Talulah... you can't, you can't go to them! Those black-hearted patrolling bugs eat people alive!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I can't just stand by and let them torture the men and women of this village. I have to see this through. I'll lure them away, give them a wake-up call, let them know what they've wrought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what's right. I'm not letting them punish these people. I'm not letting them murder anyone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still remember how the boy next door was beaten to death for chucking a stone. I'll never forget.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah... Talulah! You can't... that's enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who?! Who's at the door...!? Is it the patrolmen?! Go away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am, it's me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alina! Come in, come in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorclosequite",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong? What's happened? Is there news?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Someone told.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Told what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Patrol Unit knows there's an Infected in our village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How could... this can't be... ahh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know who it was, but we all know what happens to those who harbor Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am, my father passed early, and you took such good care of my mother, you and your husband both. You're like grandparents to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "And at this point, I can't really hide anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss, where did the Mister go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
