    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Bloody old fart, what are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I committed a crime!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082",
        "name2": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A confession? Ah, yeah, I remember.  An old geezer got in our guy's way. Judging by your limp, you were one of the thugs who attacked him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082",
        "name2": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yup!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082",
        "name2": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Not that you look worth the trouble. Go take a bloody hike. No point in dirtying our hands over a miserable little wretch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082",
        "name2": "avg_npc_092#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold it. Sir, look at my skin here. What's that look like to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Infected! You're the Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_snowconutryinside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you serious?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I realized the moment I helped you change clothes... Talulah, we've known you were Infected for a long time now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "How\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "The old man worked the mines, and came back after he'd caught Oripathy himself! You've seen how he never takes off that jacket of his...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's going to go in your place, Talulah...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "But how could he have been...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't trust the people here like that! The villagers will say whatever they need to, for money or to save their own skins!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the last two years, Talulah, we've been truly happy to have you! You're a good girl... a good girl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have long left to live, but Talulah, even if you're ill, you've still got years yet! You need to live, Talulah, that's what's right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, don't go! For heaven's sakes, don't go...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
